### Welcome Endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/
Accept: application/json

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:3000/health
Accept: application/json

### Get All Movies
GET http://localhost:3000/movies
Accept: application/json

### Get Movie by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Accept: application/json

### Create New Movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inception",
  "year": 2010,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "rating": 8.8
}

### Update Movie (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:3000/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Dark Knight Rises",
  "year": 2012,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan", 
  "genre": "Action",
  "rating": 8.4
}

### Partial Update (PATCH)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/movies/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 9.1
}

### Delete Movie
DELETE http://localhost:3000/movies/3
Accept: application/json

### Test Invalid ID
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/abc
Accept: application/json

### Test Non-existent Movie
GET http://localhost:3000/movies/999
Accept: application/json

### Create Another Movie
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Blade Runner 2049",
  "year": 2017,
  "director": "Denis Villeneuve",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "rating": 8.0
}

### Test Duplicate Movie (Should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "The Dark Knight",
  "year": 2008,
  "director": "Christopher Nolan",
  "genre": "Action",
  "rating": 9.0
}

### Test Invalid Data (Should fail)
POST http://localhost:3000/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "year": "invalid",
  "director": "",
  "genre": ""
}
